{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>萬聖節前夕（10月31日），在有百年歷史的二級歷史建築——牛棚藝術村，「藝術到家」策劃了《鬼咁有文化：鬼話傳心術》活動，有「非遺拉糖」、「傳統紙紮」與「創意Make Up Jamming」等活動。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"676\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7408-1024x676.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7447-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"685\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7495-1024x685.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7402-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"708\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7397-1024x708.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7385-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"659\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7364-1024x659.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7350-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_7275-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"637\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-co